e.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />osioned, shot, stabbed, and then dropped in a river in Russia in WINTER.. and cause of death: Drowning... so maybe just has a decent Life Arcana.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/205-songtress","name":"Songtress","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar205_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T00:32:27-07:00","id":976408,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Eren Yeager from Attack on Titan<br /> Thyrsus with an affinity for increasing reflexes and such in tight situations<br /> Legacy involving transforming size and physical attributes drastically<br /> Probably awakened when he was swallowed whole</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T03:48:45-07:00","id":977096,"title":"","content":"Danny from Stephen King's &quot;The Shining&quot;. He is a very young Moros Mage with one dot in Death (he can see ghosts but doesn't seem to be able to affect them much), two dots in Mind (being able to read people quite well and at the end manages to use it to save his life), one dot in Space (he can track where lost things are) and probably one dot in Fate (because he seems to understand important events when he sees them).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9849-aristarkos","name":"Aristarkos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9849_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T05:05:16-07:00","id":977125,"title":"","content":"Then he's a Mastigos","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}